---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, experience, education, skillGroups, focus } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description="黄瑞瑞（榕 / Rick Shota），前端工程师，3 年经验，专注工程化与 AI 应用。"
>
  <article class="about wrap">
    <header class="about-head">
      <h1>关于</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">黄瑞瑞 · 前端工程师 · 3 年经验</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        我是黄瑞瑞，网名榕（Rick Shota），安徽人。3 年前端开发经验，现在在易立德做中后台与前端基建。
      </p>
      <p>
        我的工作大致分三块：把业务系统做稳（中后台、数据可视化、工作流），把重复的事工程化（Monorepo、组件库、CI/CD），把 AI 真正用进研发流程（大模型接入、AI 应用前端）。
      </p>

      <h2>工作经历</h2>
      {experience.map((job) => (
        <section class="job">
          <h3>{job.company}</h3>
          <p class="job-meta">{job.period} · {job.role}</p>
          <ul>
            {job.points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </section>
      ))}

      <h2>教育</h2>
      <p>{education.school} · {education.major} · {education.period}</p>
      <ul>
        {education.honors.map((honor) => <li>{honor}</li>)}
      </ul>

      <h2>技术栈</h2>
      <dl class="stack-list">
        {skillGroups.map((row) => (
          <div class="stack-row">
            <dt>{row.group}</dt>
            <dd>{row.items.join(' / ')}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>

      <h2>关注方向</h2>
      <ul>
        {focus.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>

      <h2>联系</h2>
      <p>
        邮件：<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
        GitHub：<a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/RickShota</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about-head {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about .prose {
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .job {
    margin-top: 1.6em;
    padding-bottom: 1.2em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .job:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .job h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .job-meta {
    margin-top: 0.2em;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .stack-list {
    margin: 1.2em 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .stack-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.55em 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .stack-row:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .stack-row dt {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .stack-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .stack-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
